  "hypothesis": "Only when both AF2 and RF2 interface PAE are below 10 angstrom, add AF2/design complex RMSD as a weak third term with weights 2:2:1; elsewhere retain interface consensus. Structural recapitulation may distinguish well-predicted interfaces, whereas RMSD on unresolved complexes is hard to interpret. One fixed 10 angstrom regime and predeclared weights, no threshold or weight search.",
